  "aiContextParagraph": "The Union Cabinet has cleared a proposal to increase the number of parliamentary seats by 50%, sparking significant political debate. Ahead of a special session of Parliament, the BJP has initiated briefings for its members regarding this measure and existing women's reservation legislation. In response, opposition parties under the INDIA bloc are holding strategic meetings to determine their stance. Reports indicate internal friction within the opposition, with some factions raising concerns about the potential for gerrymandering and a weakening of federalism. Specific apprehension exists regarding the potential to distort political representation and exacerbate the demographic gap between northern and southern states. While some regional leaders have expressed conditional support after securing specific assurances, other partners within alliances, such as the Maha Vikas Aghadi, have shown signs of internal disagreement over the proposal.",
